<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <title>{title}</title>
    <meta name="description" content="{description}">
    <script type="application/jay-data" contract="./page.jay-contract"></script>
    <script type="application/jay-headless" plugin="@jay-framework/ui-kit" contract="clipboard-copy"></script>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="https://static.wixstatic.com/shapes/c569b3_448c7c0df8024b2786885af2054a24a8.svg">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="../styles/theme.css" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:wght,FILL@100..700,0..1&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
      /* ── Shared ── */
      .section { padding: 96px 0; }
      .section-label {
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 500;
        line-height: 16px;
        color: var(--color-primary);
        letter-spacing: 0.4em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }
      .text-muted { color: var(--color-text-muted); }
      .text-primary { color: var(--color-primary); }
      .text-center { text-align: center; }

      .glass-panel {
        background: rgba(10, 15, 30, 0.7);
        backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
        border: 1px solid rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.1);
        transition: border-color 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
      }
      .glass-panel:hover {
        border-color: rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.3);
        box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.05);
      }

      /* ── Header ── */
      .site-header {
        position: fixed;
        top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
        z-index: 50;
        background: rgba(14, 19, 34, 0.7);
        backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(60, 73, 78, 0.2);
      }
      .header-inner {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        max-width: var(--max-width);
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 16px var(--margin-mobile);
      }
      @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .header-inner { padding: 16px var(--margin-desktop); }
      }
      @keyframes brand-shimmer {
        0%  { background-position: -200% center; }
        100%  { background-position:  400% center; }
      }
      .header-brand {
        position: relative;
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 32px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.01em;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      .brand-icon {
        width: 32px;
        height: 32px;
        flex-shrink: 0;
      }
      .brand-text-wrap {
        position: relative;
        display: inline-block;
      }
      .header-brand .brand-base {
        color: var(--color-primary);
      }
      .header-brand .brand-shine {
        position: absolute;
        top: 0;
        left: 0;
        background: linear-gradient(105deg,
          transparent 40%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85) 45%,
          rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.9) 50%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85) 55%, transparent 60%);
        background-size: 300% auto;
        background-repeat: no-repeat;
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        background-clip: text;
        color: transparent;
        animation: brand-shimmer 5s linear infinite;
      }
      .header-nav {
        display: none;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 32px;
      }
      @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .header-nav { display: flex; }
      }
      .header-nav a {
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 500;
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        text-decoration: none;
        transition: color 0.3s;
      }
      .header-nav a:hover { color: var(--color-primary); text-decoration: none; }
      .header-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; }
      .btn-get-started {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        background: var(--color-primary-container);
        color: var(--color-on-primary-container);
        padding: 8px 24px;
        border: none;
        border-radius: var(--radius-default);
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 700;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      .btn-get-started:hover {
        transform: scale(1.05);
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      /* ── Hero ── */
      .hero {
        position: relative;
        min-height: 90vh;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        overflow: hidden;
        padding-top: 96px;
      }
      .hero-grid {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background-image:
          linear-gradient(rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.05) 1px, transparent 1px),
          linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.05) 1px, transparent 1px);
        background-size: 40px 40px;
        opacity: 0.3;
        z-index: 0;
      }
      .hero-content {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        text-align: center;
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 1200px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        gap: 48px;
        padding: 48px 0;
      }
      @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .hero-content {
          flex-direction: row;
          text-align: left;
          align-items: center;
          gap: 64px;
        }
      }
      .hero-logo-wrapper {
        position: relative;
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 500px;
        flex-shrink: 0;
      }
      @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .hero-logo-wrapper {
          width: 45%;
        }
      }
      .hero-logo-glow {
        position: absolute;
        inset: -16px;
        background: rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.2);
        filter: blur(100px);
        border-radius: 50%;
      }
      .hero-logo {
        position: relative;
        width: 100%;
        z-index: 1;
        filter: brightness(1.1) drop-shadow(0 25px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5));
      }
      .hero-headline {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 48px);
        line-height: 1.15;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        color: var(--color-primary);
        text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(71, 214, 255, 0.5);
      }
      .hero-subtitle {
        font-size: 18px;
        line-height: 28px;
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        max-width: 700px;
        margin-left: auto;
        margin-right: auto;
      }
      @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .hero-subtitle {
          margin-left: 0;
        }
      }
      .hero-buttons {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 16px;
      }
      @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .hero-buttons {
          justify-content: flex-start;
        }
      }
      .btn-primary {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        background: var(--color-primary-container);
        color: var(--color-on-primary-container);
        padding: 16px 32px;
        border: none;
        border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-weight: 700;
        font-size: 16px;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: box-shadow 0.3s, transform 0.2s;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      .btn-primary:hover {
        box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.3);
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      .btn-secondary {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.3);
        background: rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.05);
        color: var(--color-text);
        padding: 16px 32px;
        border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-weight: 700;
        font-size: 16px;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: background 0.3s;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      .btn-secondary:hover {
        background: rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.1);
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      .btn-copy-cmd {
        cursor: pointer;
      }
      .copy-icon {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        opacity: 0.6;
        transition: opacity 0.2s;
      }
      .btn-copy-cmd:hover .copy-icon {
        opacity: 1;
      }
      .hero-stats {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 24px;
        padding-top: 16px;
      }
      @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .hero-stats {
          justify-content: flex-start;
        }
      }
      .stat-item { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }
      .stat-value {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 24px;
        line-height: 32px;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--color-primary);
      }
      .stat-label {
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 500;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.15em;
        color: var(--color-outline);
      }
      .stat-divider {
        width: 1px;
        height: 40px;
        background: rgba(133, 147, 153, 0.2);
      }

      /* ── What is Jay ── */
      .whatjay-section { background: var(--color-surface); }
      .whatjay-cards {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: var(--space-gutter);
        margin-top: 48px;
      }
      @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .whatjay-cards { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
      }
      .whatjay-card {
        padding: 32px;
        border-radius: var(--radius-2xl);
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
      }
      .whatjay-card img {
        width: 100%;
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      }
      .whatjay-card h3 {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 20px;
        font-weight: 600;
        line-height: 28px;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }
      .whatjay-card .whatjay-tagline {
        color: var(--color-primary);
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 13px;
        font-weight: 500;
        line-height: 19px;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }
      .whatjay-card p.whatjay-desc {
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 24px;
      }

      /* ── Ecosystem & Plugins (Bento Grid) ── */
      .ecosystem-section { background: var(--color-surface-lowest); position: relative; }
      .eco-bento {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 16px;
        margin-top: 48px;
      }
      @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .eco-bento {
          grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
        }
      }
      @media (min-width: 1024px) {
        .eco-bento {
          grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
          grid-auto-flow: dense;
        }
      }
      .eco-bento-card {
        padding: 24px 28px;
        border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 8px;
      }
      .eco-bento-label {
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 10px;
        font-weight: 600;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        opacity: 0.7;
        margin-bottom: 4px;
      }
      .eco-bento-label--guardrails { color: #6ecfff; }
      .eco-bento-label--wix { color: #a78bfa; }
      .eco-bento-label--content { color: #34d399; }
      .eco-bento-label--agents { color: #fb923c; }
      .eco-bento-label--core { color: var(--color-primary); }
      .eco-bento-card strong {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 17px;
        font-weight: 600;
        line-height: 24px;
        color: var(--color-text);
      }
      .eco-bento-card p {
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        font-size: 14px;
        line-height: 22px;
      }
      .eco-bento-wide {
        grid-column: span 1;
      }
      @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .eco-bento-wide {
          grid-column: span 2;
        }
      }
      .eco-bento-card--with-image {
        gap: 24px;
      }
      .eco-bento-card--with-image .eco-bento-card-text {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 8px;
      }
      .eco-bento-card--with-image .eco-bento-card-image {
        align-self: center;
        width: 140px;
      }
      .eco-bento-card--with-image .eco-bento-card-image img {
        width: 100%;
        height: auto;
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
        object-fit: contain;
      }
      @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .eco-bento-card--with-image {
          flex-direction: row;
          align-items: center;
        }
        .eco-bento-card--with-image .eco-bento-card-text {
          flex: 1;
          min-width: 0;
        }
        .eco-bento-card--with-image .eco-bento-card-image {
          flex-shrink: 0;
          width: 180px;
        }
      }
      .eco-bento-tall {
        grid-row: span 1;
      }
      @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .eco-bento-tall {
          grid-row: span 2;
        }
      }

      /* ── Feedback Loop ── */
      .feedback-section { background: var(--color-surface); }
      .feedback-image-frame {
        max-width: 900px;
        margin: 48px auto 0;
        border-radius: var(--radius-3xl);
        overflow: hidden;
        padding: 16px;
      }
      .feedback-image-frame img {
        width: 100%;
        border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
      }

      /* ── Feedback Steps ── */
      .feedback-steps {
        margin-top: 64px;
        max-width: 1000px;
        margin-left: auto;
        margin-right: auto;
        column-gap: 24px;
      }
      @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .feedback-steps { columns: 2; }
      }
      .feedback-step {
        padding: 32px;
        border-radius: var(--radius-2xl);
        break-inside: avoid;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      }
      .feedback-step-number {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        width: 32px;
        height: 32px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.15);
        color: var(--color-primary);
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 14px;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }
      .feedback-step h3 {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 20px;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }
      .feedback-step p {
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 24px;
      }
      .feedback-step ul {
        list-style: none;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 8px;
        margin-top: 12px;
        padding: 0;
      }
      .feedback-step ul li {
        position: relative;
        padding-left: 16px;
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 24px;
      }
      .feedback-step ul li::before {
        content: '\2022';
        color: var(--color-primary);
        position: absolute;
        left: 0;
      }
      .feedback-step ul li strong {
        color: var(--color-text);
      }

      /* ── Agent Roles ── */
      .roles-section { background: var(--color-surface-lowest); position: relative; }
      .roles-grid-bg {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        opacity: 0.1;
        pointer-events: none;
        overflow: hidden;
      }
      .roles-grid-bg-inner {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(12, 1fr);
        height: 100%;
      }
      .roles-grid-bg-inner > div { border-right: 1px solid rgba(133, 147, 153, 0.2); }
      .roles-image-frame {
        position: relative;
        border-radius: var(--radius-3xl);
        overflow: hidden;
        border: 1px solid rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.2);
        margin-bottom: 64px;
      }
      .roles-image-frame img { width: 100%; }
      .roles-image-frame.glass-panel {
        background: none;
        backdrop-filter: none;
      }
      .roles-cards {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: var(--space-gutter);
      }
      @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .roles-cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
      }
      @media (min-width: 1024px) {
        .roles-cards { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); }
      }
      .role-card {
        padding: 32px;
        border-radius: var(--radius-2xl);
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
      }
      .role-card--designer { box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(176, 122, 237, 0.25), 0 0 4px rgba(176, 122, 237, 0.15); }
      .role-card--developer { box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(106, 191, 75, 0.25), 0 0 4px rgba(106, 191, 75, 0.15); }
      .role-card--plugin { box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(212, 149, 46, 0.25), 0 0 4px rgba(212, 149, 46, 0.15); }
      .role-card--devops { box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(91, 140, 201, 0.25), 0 0 4px rgba(91, 140, 201, 0.15); }
      .role-icon {
        width: 80px;
        height: 80px;
        object-fit: contain;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      }
      .role-card h3 {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 24px;
        line-height: 32px;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }
      .role-card p {
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
      }

      /* ── Plugins ── */
      .plugins-section { background: var(--color-surface); }
      .plugins-layout {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 64px;
        align-items: center;
      }
      @media (min-width: 1024px) {
        .plugins-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
      }
      .plugins-image-frame {
        border-radius: var(--radius-3xl);
        overflow: hidden;
        border: 1px solid rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.2);
      }
      .plugins-image-frame img { width: 100%; }
      .plugins-text h2 { margin-bottom: 24px; }
      .plugins-tagline {
        font-style: italic;
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        font-size: 18px;
        line-height: 28px;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      }
      .plugins-body {
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 26px;
        margin-bottom: 32px;
      }
      .plugins-features { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; padding: 0; }
      .plugins-features li {
        position: relative;
        padding-left: 16px;
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        line-height: 24px;
      }
      .plugins-features li::before {
        content: '\2022';
        color: var(--color-primary);
        position: absolute;
        left: 0;
      }
      .plugins-features li strong { color: var(--color-text); }

      /* ── Contract ── */
      .contract-section { }
      .contract-layout {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 64px;
        align-items: center;
      }
      @media (min-width: 1024px) {
        .contract-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
      }
      .contract-badge {
        display: inline-block;
        background: rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.1);
        color: var(--color-primary);
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 500;
        padding: 4px 12px;
        border-radius: 9999px;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      }
      .contract-text h2 { margin-bottom: 24px; }
      .contract-text p {
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        font-size: 18px;
        line-height: 28px;
        margin-bottom: 32px;
      }
      .contract-checklist { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; padding: 0; }
      .contract-checklist li {
        position: relative;
        padding-left: 16px;
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        line-height: 24px;
      }
      .contract-checklist li::before {
        content: '\2022';
        color: var(--color-primary);
        position: absolute;
        left: 0;
      }

      /* Code tabs */
      .code-panel {
        border-radius: var(--radius-2xl);
        overflow: hidden;
        border: 1px solid rgba(60, 73, 78, 0.3);
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        height: 520px;
      }
      .code-tabs {
        display: flex;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(60, 73, 78, 0.3);
        background: var(--color-surface-low);
      }
      .code-tab {
        padding: 16px 24px;
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 500;
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        border: none;
        background: none;
        cursor: pointer;
        border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;
        transition: color 0.2s;
      }
      .code-tab:hover { color: var(--color-primary); }
      .code-panel-content {
        display: none;
        flex: 1;
        padding: 24px;
        background: var(--color-surface-lowest);
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 13px;
        line-height: 19px;
        overflow: auto;
        color: var(--color-secondary-dim);
      }
      .code-line {
        white-space: pre;
        min-height: 19px;
      }
      .cb::before { content: '{'; }
      .ce::before { content: '}'; }
      #code-tab-contract:checked ~ .code-tabs label[for="code-tab-contract"],
      #code-tab-html:checked ~ .code-tabs label[for="code-tab-html"],
      #code-tab-types:checked ~ .code-tabs label[for="code-tab-types"],
      #code-tab-component:checked ~ .code-tabs label[for="code-tab-component"] {
        color: var(--color-primary);
        border-bottom-color: var(--color-primary);
      }
      #code-tab-contract:checked ~ .code-panels #panel-contract,
      #code-tab-html:checked ~ .code-panels #panel-html,
      #code-tab-types:checked ~ .code-panels #panel-types,
      #code-tab-component:checked ~ .code-panels #panel-component {
        display: block;
      }

      /* ── Full Stack ── */
      .fullstack-section {
        background: #0A0F1E;
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
      }
      .fullstack-layout {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 48px;
      }
      @media (min-width: 1024px) {
        .fullstack-layout {
          flex-direction: row;
          align-items: stretch;
          gap: 48px;
        }
      }
      .fullstack-image {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: flex-start;
      }
      @media (min-width: 1024px) {
        .fullstack-image {
          flex-shrink: 0;
          width: 45%;
        }
      }
      .fullstack-image img {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 500px;
        filter: drop-shadow(0 0 50px rgba(255, 170, 0, 0.2));
      }
      /* Vertical tabs for layers */
      .fullstack-tabs { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0; flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
      .fullstack-tabs input[type="radio"] { display: none; }
      .fullstack-tabs-inner {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 0;
      }
      @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .fullstack-tabs-inner { flex-direction: row; }
      }
      .fullstack-tab-nav {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: row;
        overflow-x: auto;
        gap: 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(60, 73, 78, 0.3);
      }
      @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .fullstack-tab-nav {
          flex-direction: column;
          flex-shrink: 0;
          width: 240px;
          border-bottom: none;
          border-right: 1px solid rgba(60, 73, 78, 0.3);
          overflow-x: visible;
        }
      }
      .fullstack-tab-label {
        display: block;
        padding: 16px 24px;
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 14px;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        cursor: pointer;
        border-left: 3px solid transparent;
        transition: color 0.2s, background 0.2s;
        white-space: nowrap;
      }
      .fullstack-tab-label:hover {
        color: var(--color-primary);
        background: rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.03);
      }
      .fullstack-tab-panels {
        flex: 1;
        min-height: 200px;
      }
      .fullstack-tab-panel {
        display: none;
        padding: 24px 32px;
      }
      .fullstack-tab-panel h3 {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 22px;
        line-height: 30px;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--color-primary);
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }
      .fullstack-tab-panel p {
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 26px;
      }
      /* Tab checked states */
      #fs-tab-1:checked ~ .fullstack-tabs-inner .fullstack-tab-nav label[for="fs-tab-1"],
      #fs-tab-2:checked ~ .fullstack-tabs-inner .fullstack-tab-nav label[for="fs-tab-2"],
      #fs-tab-3:checked ~ .fullstack-tabs-inner .fullstack-tab-nav label[for="fs-tab-3"],
      #fs-tab-4:checked ~ .fullstack-tabs-inner .fullstack-tab-nav label[for="fs-tab-4"],
      #fs-tab-5:checked ~ .fullstack-tabs-inner .fullstack-tab-nav label[for="fs-tab-5"] {
        color: var(--color-primary);
        background: rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.05);
        border-left-color: var(--color-primary);
      }
      #fs-tab-1:checked ~ .fullstack-tabs-inner .fullstack-tab-panels #fs-panel-1,
      #fs-tab-2:checked ~ .fullstack-tabs-inner .fullstack-tab-panels #fs-panel-2,
      #fs-tab-3:checked ~ .fullstack-tabs-inner .fullstack-tab-panels #fs-panel-3,
      #fs-tab-4:checked ~ .fullstack-tabs-inner .fullstack-tab-panels #fs-panel-4,
      #fs-tab-5:checked ~ .fullstack-tabs-inner .fullstack-tab-panels #fs-panel-5 {
        display: block;
      }

      /* ── Real-World Value (Bento Grid) ── */
      .value-section { }
      .bento-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 24px;
      }
      @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .bento-grid {
          grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
          grid-template-rows: auto auto;
          min-height: 600px;
        }
        .bento-wide { grid-column: span 2; }
        .bento-tall { grid-row: span 2; }
      }
      .bento-card {
        padding: 40px;
        border-radius: var(--radius-3xl);
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
      }
      .bento-card--performance {
        position: relative;
      }
      .bento-card--performance .bento-icon-corner {
        position: relative;
      }
      .bento-card--performance .bento-icon-corner img {
        opacity: 0.85;
        transition: opacity 0.3s;
      }
      .bento-card--performance:hover .bento-icon-corner img {
        opacity: 1;
      }
      .lighthouse-hint {
        position: absolute;
        top: 100%; /* design-system: allow */
        right: 0;
        padding-top: 8px;
        opacity: 0;
        pointer-events: none;
        transition: opacity 0.2s;
        z-index: 2;
      }
      .lighthouse-hint-inner {
        padding: 8px 14px;
        background: var(--color-surface-high);
        border: 1px solid rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.2);
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
        font-size: 13px;
        line-height: 18px;
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        white-space: nowrap;
      }
      .lighthouse-hint a {
        color: var(--color-primary);
        text-decoration: underline;
      }
      .bento-icon-corner:hover .lighthouse-hint {
        opacity: 1;
        pointer-events: auto;
      }
      .bento-card--visual-editor {
        justify-content: space-between;
      }
      .bento-card--risk {
        gap: 16px;
      }
      .bento-card--assembly {
        gap: 16px;
      }
      .bento-icon { font-size: 48px; margin-bottom: 32px; }
      .bento-card h3 { margin-bottom: 16px; }

      .bento-features {
        list-style: none;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 12px;
        margin-top: 16px;
        padding: 0;
      }
      .bento-features li {
        position: relative;
        padding-left: 16px;
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 24px;
      }
      .bento-features li::before {
        content: '\2022';
        color: var(--color-primary);
        position: absolute;
        left: 0;
      }
      .bento-features li strong {
        color: var(--color-text);
      }

      /* ── CTA ── */
      .cta-section { padding: 96px 0; }
      .cta-box {
        padding: 64px;
        border-radius: 2rem;
        border: 2px solid rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.2);
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .cta-glow-tl {
        position: absolute;
        top: -96px; /* design-system: allow */
        left: -96px; /* design-system: allow */
        width: 256px; height: 256px;
        background: rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.2);
        border-radius: 50%;
        filter: blur(48px);
        pointer-events: none;
      }
      .cta-glow-br {
        position: absolute;
        bottom: -96px; /* design-system: allow */
        right: -96px; /* design-system: allow */
        width: 256px; height: 256px;
        background: rgba(0, 244, 254, 0.1);
        border-radius: 50%;
        filter: blur(48px);
        pointer-events: none;
      }
      .cta-box h2 { margin-bottom: 32px; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
      .cta-buttons {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 16px;
        justify-content: center;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
      }
      @media (min-width: 640px) {
        .cta-buttons { flex-direction: row; }
      }
      .btn-cta-primary {
        background: var(--color-primary-container);
        color: var(--color-on-primary-container);
        padding: 20px 40px;
        border: none;
        border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-weight: 700;
        font-size: 18px;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: transform 0.2s;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      .btn-cta-primary:hover { transform: scale(1.05); text-decoration: none; }
      .btn-cta-secondary {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        color: var(--color-text);
        padding: 20px 40px;
        border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-weight: 700;
        font-size: 18px;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: background 0.3s;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      .btn-cta-secondary:hover {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      /* ── Footer ── */
      .site-footer {
        background: var(--color-surface-lowest);
        border-top: 1px solid rgba(60, 73, 78, 0.2);
        padding: 48px 0;
      }
      .footer-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: var(--space-gutter);
      }
      @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
      }
      @media (min-width: 1024px) {
        .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 2fr; }
      }
      .footer-brand {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 24px;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: var(--color-primary);
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      }
      .footer-copyright {
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 12px;
        line-height: 16px;
      }
      .footer-heading {
        color: var(--color-primary);
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.15em;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      }
      .footer-links { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }

      .footer-links a {
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 12px;
        transition: color 0.3s;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      .footer-links a:hover { color: var(--color-secondary-dim); text-decoration: none; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="page-root">

    <!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
    <!-- Header                                      -->
    <!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
    <header class="site-header">
      <nav class="header-inner">
        <a href="/" class="header-brand"><img src="https://static.wixstatic.com/shapes/c569b3_448c7c0df8024b2786885af2054a24a8.svg" alt="" class="brand-icon" width="32" height="32" loading="eager"><span class="brand-text-wrap"><span class="brand-base">Jay Framework</span><span class="brand-shine" aria-hidden="true">Jay Framework</span></span></a>
        <div class="header-nav">
          <a href="#feedback-loop">Ecosystem</a>
          <a href="#agent-roles">Agents</a>
          <a href="#contract">The Contract</a>
          <a href="#full-stack">Full Stack</a>
          <a href="#value">Performance</a>
        </div>
        <div class="header-actions">
          <a href="https://github.com/jay-framework/jay/" target="_blank" style="color: var(--color-text-muted); display: flex; align-items: center; transition: color 0.3s;" aria-label="GitHub"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><g fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 0c-6.626 0-12 5.373-12 12 0 5.302 3.438 9.8 8.207 11.387.599.111.793-.261.793-.577v-2.234c-3.338.726-4.033-1.416-4.033-1.416-.546-1.387-1.333-1.756-1.333-1.756-1.089-.745.083-.729.083-.729 1.205.084 1.839 1.237 1.839 1.237 1.07 1.834 2.807 1.304 3.492.997.107-.775.418-1.305.762-1.604-2.665-.305-5.467-1.334-5.467-5.931 0-1.311.469-2.381 1.236-3.221-.124-.303-.535-1.524.117-3.176 0 0 1.008-.322 3.301 1.23.957-.266 1.983-.399 3.003-.404 1.02.005 2.047.138 3.006.404 2.291-1.552 3.297-1.23 3.297-1.23.653 1.653.242 2.874.118 3.176.77.84 1.235 1.911 1.235 3.221 0 4.609-2.807 5.624-5.479 5.921.43.372.823 1.102.823 2.222v3.293c0 .319.192.694.801.576 4.765-1.589 8.199-6.086 8.199-11.386 0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12z"></path></g></svg></a>
          <a class="btn-get-started" href="#cta">Get Started</a>
        </div>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>

      <!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
      <!-- Hero                                        -->
      <!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
      <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-grid"></div>
        <div class="container">
          <div class="hero-content">
            <div class="hero-logo-wrapper">
              <div class="hero-logo-glow"></div>
              <img class="hero-logo" src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c569b3_c77476bfb6564842814a9b4f3b6854fb~mv2.png/v1/fit/w_500,h_500/file.webp" srcset="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c569b3_c77476bfb6564842814a9b4f3b6854fb~mv2.png/v1/fit/w_300%2Ch_300/file.webp 300w, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c569b3_c77476bfb6564842814a9b4f3b6854fb~mv2.png/v1/fit/w_500%2Ch_500/file.webp 500w" sizes="(max-width: 600px) 80vw, 500px" alt="Jay Framework Logo" width="500" height="500" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high">
            </div>
            <div>
              <h1 class="hero-headline">The web framework for AI Agents</h1>
              <p class="hero-subtitle" style="margin-top: 32px;">Build production-ready web apps with AI agents. Jay combines strict code contracts, automated feedback loops, and a visual editor to guarantee bug-free code before deployment.</p>
              <div class="hero-buttons" style="margin-top: 32px;">
                <a class="btn-primary" href="#cta">Get Started</a>
                <jay:clipboard-copy text="npm create jay@latest">
                  <button ref="copyBtn" class="btn-secondary btn-copy-cmd" style="font-family: var(--font-mono);">
                    <span>npm create jay@latest</span>
                    <span if="!copied" class="copy-icon" aria-label="Copy to clipboard"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="9" y="9" width="13" height="13" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"></path></svg></span>
                    <span if="copied" class="copy-icon" aria-live="polite"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg></span>
                  </button>
                </jay:clipboard-copy>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
      <!-- What is Jay                                  -->
      <!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
      <section id="what-is-jay" class="section whatjay-section">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="text-center">
            <h2 class="headline-lg">What is Jay</h2>
            <p class="headline-sm text-muted" style="margin-top: 16px; max-width: 800px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">Engineered from the ground up for AI web development.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="whatjay-cards">
            <div class="whatjay-card glass-panel">
              <img src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c569b3_28d5b6b49bd14042b0eae9070028acf6~mv2.png/v1/fit/w_400,h_225/file.webp" srcset="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c569b3_28d5b6b49bd14042b0eae9070028acf6~mv2.png/v1/fit/w_300%2Ch_169/file.webp 300w, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c569b3_28d5b6b49bd14042b0eae9070028acf6~mv2.png/v1/fit/w_400%2Ch_225/file.webp 400w" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 33vw" alt="Jay contracts — strict separation of UI and backend logic" width="400" height="225" loading="lazy">
              <h3>AI-First Contracts</h3>
              <p class="whatjay-tagline">Decouple UI from backend logic.</p>
              <p class="whatjay-desc">Jay uses strict .jay-contract files to separate visual templates (.jay-html) from backend code (page.ts). AI agents can completely redesign your interface without breaking underlying business logic.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="whatjay-card glass-panel">
              <img src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c569b3_24314805b6ba4328b4bbf0c1614eb725~mv2.png/v1/fit/w_400,h_225/file.webp" srcset="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c569b3_24314805b6ba4328b4bbf0c1614eb725~mv2.png/v1/fit/w_300%2Ch_169/file.webp 300w, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c569b3_24314805b6ba4328b4bbf0c1614eb725~mv2.png/v1/fit/w_400%2Ch_225/file.webp 400w" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 33vw" alt="Jay AIditor — visual editing by intent" width="400" height="225" loading="lazy">
              <h3>Visual AIditor</h3>
              <p class="whatjay-tagline">Edit web apps visually by intent.</p>
              <p class="whatjay-desc">Convert screenshots or live URLs into contract-bound sites. Simply point at any element on screen, describe your change, and let the AI update production code directly.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="whatjay-card glass-panel">
              <img src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c569b3_7b7628e89857472c9c2c979ba1f24640~mv2.png/v1/fit/w_400,h_225/file.webp" srcset="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c569b3_7b7628e89857472c9c2c979ba1f24640~mv2.png/v1/fit/w_300%2Ch_169/file.webp 300w, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c569b3_7b7628e89857472c9c2c979ba1f24640~mv2.png/v1/fit/w_400%2Ch_225/file.webp 400w" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 33vw" alt="Lighthouse scores — automated validation guardrails" width="400" height="225" loading="lazy">
              <h3>Self-Correcting Loop</h3>
              <p class="whatjay-tagline">Automated guardrails prevent broken code.</p>
              <p class="whatjay-desc">An automated engine validates AI output across contracts, SEO, accessibility, and performance. When an agent makes a mistake, it receives targeted error feedback to self-correct instantly before deployment.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
      <!-- Ecosystem & Plugins                          -->
      <!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
      <section id="ecosystem" class="section ecosystem-section">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="text-center">
            <span class="section-label">Ecosystem &amp; Plugins</span>
            <h2 class="headline-lg" style="margin-top: 16px;">Extensible by design.<br>Built for zero-coding app assembly.</h2>
            <p class="headline-sm text-muted" style="margin-top: 16px; max-width: 900px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">Jay plugins bundle pre-tested capabilities, server actions, and contracts into drop-in NPM packages.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="eco-bento">

            <!-- AI Guardrails & Validation -->
            <div class="eco-bento-card glass-panel">
              <span class="eco-bento-label eco-bento-label--guardrails">AI Guardrails</span>
              <strong>SEO Validator</strong>
              <p>Checks jay-html templates for SEO best practices — meta tags, heading hierarchy, canonical URLs, and Open Graph data.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="eco-bento-card glass-panel">
              <span class="eco-bento-label eco-bento-label--guardrails">AI Guardrails</span>
              <strong>Accessibility Validator</strong>
              <p>Validates templates against WCAG guidelines — image alt text, ARIA roles, keyboard navigation, and semantic HTML.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="eco-bento-card glass-panel eco-bento-wide eco-bento-card--with-image">
              <div class="eco-bento-card-text">
                <span class="eco-bento-label eco-bento-label--guardrails">AI Guardrails</span>
                <strong>Design System Validator</strong>
                <p>Enforces DESIGN.md tokens across your CSS — colors, spacing, typography, contrast ratios, and component structure. Catches brand drift before it ships.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="eco-bento-card-image">
                <img src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c569b3_a8c585bd797f434ca9646efc91b185c2~mv2.png/v1/fit/w_180,h_180/file.webp" alt="Design System Validator" width="180" height="180" loading="lazy">
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Wix Headless Integration -->
            <div class="eco-bento-card glass-panel eco-bento-wide eco-bento-card--with-image">
              <div class="eco-bento-card-text">
                <span class="eco-bento-label eco-bento-label--wix">Wix Headless</span>
                <strong>Wix Stores &amp; Cart</strong>
                <p>Full e-commerce stack — product catalogs, variant resolution, category browsing, and a complete cart with mini-cart drawer, line-item management, and checkout.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="eco-bento-card-image">
                <img src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c569b3_3fc0153dea0d48b78458f46fd140725c~mv2.png/v1/fit/w_180,h_180/file.webp" alt="Wix Stores and Cart" width="180" height="180" loading="lazy">
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="eco-bento-card glass-panel">
              <span class="eco-bento-label eco-bento-label--wix">Wix Headless</span>
              <strong>Wix Members</strong>
              <p>OAuth authentication with login indicators, protected page guards, and callback handling. Includes server-side member operations and client-side auth state.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="eco-bento-card glass-panel">
              <span class="eco-bento-label eco-bento-label--wix">Wix Headless</span>
              <strong>Wix Data</strong>
              <p>Dynamic contract generation from collection schemas — automatically creates item, list, table, and card pages from your Wix CMS collections.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="eco-bento-card glass-panel eco-bento-tall">
              <span class="eco-bento-label eco-bento-label--wix">Wix Headless</span>
              <strong>Wix Media</strong>
              <p>Media upload, optimization validation, CDN delivery, and index generation. Ensures every image URL carries proper optimization parameters.</p>
              <img src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c569b3_3262d2cbcfa84865bb9d845e8829ae10~mv2.png/v1/fit/w_180,h_180/file.webp" alt="Wix Media" width="180" height="180" loading="lazy" style="margin-top: auto; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); align-self: center;">
            </div>
            <div class="eco-bento-card glass-panel">
              <span class="eco-bento-label eco-bento-label--wix">Wix Headless</span>
              <strong>Wix Deploy</strong>
              <p>One-click deployment to Wix infrastructure — builds entry points, uploads backend code, and deploys the full application.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- Content & UI -->
            <div class="eco-bento-card glass-panel eco-bento-wide eco-bento-card--with-image">
              <div class="eco-bento-card-text">
                <span class="eco-bento-label eco-bento-label--content">Content &amp; UI</span>
                <strong>Markdown</strong>
                <p>Three rendering modes — directory-based page generation, static inline rendering, and live dynamic updates. Includes code highlighting, mermaid-to-SVG diagrams, and automatic SEO head tags from frontmatter.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="eco-bento-card-image">
                <img src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c569b3_5917d5339da94329a78789b2d94d8011~mv2.png/v1/fit/w_180,h_180/file.webp" alt="Markdown" width="180" height="180" loading="lazy">
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="eco-bento-card glass-panel">
              <span class="eco-bento-label eco-bento-label--content">Content &amp; UI</span>
              <strong>UI Kit</strong>
              <p>Headless UI primitives — popover menus via the Popover API, scroll-snap carousels, clipboard copy with feedback, and word/letter splitting for per-character animation and styling.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="eco-bento-card glass-panel">
              <span class="eco-bento-label eco-bento-label--content">Content &amp; UI</span>
              <strong>AIditor Quill</strong>
              <p>Ready-made add-menu assets and text components for the AIditor visual editor. Provides a catalog of drop-in content blocks.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- AI Agents & Protocols -->
            <div class="eco-bento-card glass-panel eco-bento-wide">
              <span class="eco-bento-label eco-bento-label--agents">AI Agents</span>
              <strong>AIditor</strong>
              <p>Visual AI-driven code editor — agents create pages, manage plugins, edit live sites, and publish. 30+ server actions covering project info, visual editing, asset management, and deployment.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="eco-bento-card glass-panel">
              <span class="eco-bento-label eco-bento-label--agents">AI Agents</span>
              <strong>Gemini Agent</strong>
              <p>Embedded chat agent powered by Gemini with page automation and server action calling. Drops into any page as a headless component.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="eco-bento-card glass-panel">
              <span class="eco-bento-label eco-bento-label--agents">AI Agents</span>
              <strong>WebMCP</strong>
              <p>Automatically exposes page interactions as Model Context Protocol tools, resources, and prompts — connects your site natively to AI agents.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- Core Architecture -->
            <div class="eco-bento-card glass-panel eco-bento-tall">
              <span class="eco-bento-label eco-bento-label--core">Core Architecture</span>
              <strong>3-Phase Rendering</strong>
              <p>Slow (data change), Fast (per-request), and Interactive (client) phases split work so pages load in sub-second time with near-zero JavaScript overhead.</p>
              <img src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c569b3_c0a7f9f1c95e4676a93a4f68b7b04986~mv2.png/v1/fit/w_180,h_180/file.webp" alt="3-Phase Rendering" width="180" height="180" loading="lazy" style="margin-top: auto; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); align-self: center;">
            </div>
            <div class="eco-bento-card glass-panel">
              <span class="eco-bento-label eco-bento-label--core">Core Architecture</span>
              <strong>Contract-Driven Assembly</strong>
              <p>Plugins expose typed contracts — agents and developers wire full-stack features without prop-drilling, custom glue code, or framework-specific knowledge.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="eco-bento-card glass-panel">
              <span class="eco-bento-label eco-bento-label--core">Core Architecture</span>
              <strong>Agent-Optimized Token Costs</strong>
              <p>Pre-built, tested packages replace generated boilerplate. Agents reuse established contracts instead of hallucinating integrations, cutting token usage and errors.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="eco-bento-card glass-panel">
              <span class="eco-bento-label eco-bento-label--core">Core Architecture</span>
              <strong>File-Based Routing</strong>
              <p>Directory structure defines routes, dynamic [slug] segments, and page-level contracts. Predictable for developers, trivial for agents to extend.</p>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
      <!-- The Jay Feedback Loop                       -->
      <!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
      <section id="feedback-loop" class="section feedback-section">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="text-center">
            <span class="section-label">Core Architecture</span>
            <h2 class="headline-lg" style="margin-top: 16px;">The Jay Feedback Loop</h2>
            <p class="headline-sm text-muted" style="margin-top: 16px; max-width: 800px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">Guiding AI to guaranteed, production-ready results through continuous validation and strict boundaries.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feedback-image-frame glass-panel">
            <img src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c569b3_572ffd58016541448027bf6ad5b270ac~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_900,h_506/file.webp" srcset="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c569b3_572ffd58016541448027bf6ad5b270ac~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_400%2Ch_225/file.webp 400w, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c569b3_572ffd58016541448027bf6ad5b270ac~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_600%2Ch_337/file.webp 600w, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c569b3_572ffd58016541448027bf6ad5b270ac~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_900%2Ch_506/file.webp 900w" sizes="(max-width: 600px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 80vw, 900px" alt="Jay Feedback Loop Diagram — showing the self-correcting cycle of AI agents, declarative code, validation, and error feedback" width="900" height="506" loading="lazy">
          </div>

          <div class="feedback-steps">
            <div class="feedback-step glass-panel">
              <div class="feedback-step-number">1</div>
              <h3>The AI Agent (Generator)</h3>
              <p>The cycle begins with specialized AI roles (Designer, Developer, or Plugin Developer) reading the explicitly defined contracts and instructions. Because the boundaries are clear, the agent knows exactly what data it has to work with and what it needs to build.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feedback-step glass-panel">
              <div class="feedback-step-number">2</div>
              <h3>Declarative Code &amp; Logic (Output)</h3>
              <p>The AI outputs the code, adhering to Jay's strict separation of design and logic.</p>
              <ul>
                <li>The <strong>AI Designer</strong> generates purely declarative, logic-free visual templates (.jay-html), utilizing functionality from plugins.</li>
                <li>If custom functionality is needed, the <strong>AI Developer</strong> outputs the application logic in page.ts. This separation ensures agents can iterate on the UI without ever breaking the backend code.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="feedback-step glass-panel">
              <div class="feedback-step-number">3</div>
              <h3>Validation Engine (Gatekeeper)</h3>
              <p>Jay doesn't let the AI guess if its code works; it automatically acts as a strict inspection node. The framework evaluates the agent's output using comprehensive tools:</p>
              <ul>
                <li><strong>jay-stack validate:</strong> Checks for parsing and contract matching errors.</li>
                <li><strong>Tag Coverage Report:</strong> Analyzes the HTML tree to tell the AI exactly which contract tags were used, which were missed, and if any required tags were omitted.</li>
                <li><strong>TypeScript Compiler (TSC):</strong> Validates the backend logic against the auto-generated, phase-specific .d.ts types.</li>
                <li><strong>Plugin Validation:</strong> Ensures consistency between plugin.yaml configurations and component properties.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="feedback-step glass-panel">
              <div class="feedback-step-number">4</div>
              <h3>Errors + Agent-Kit References (Feedback)</h3>
              <p>If the code fails validation, the system doesn't just output a generic error. It provides an explicit path forward by pointing the agent directly back to the Agent-Kit's ground truth, referencing materialized contracts, the plugins-index.yaml, and specific Agent-Kit guides so the AI can self-correct with exact context.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
